sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Manager as ADMIN ou MANAGER
    participant UI as TendersPage
    participant NeedAPI as DepartmentNeedsController
    participant TenderAPI as TendersController
    participant OfferAPI as SupplierOffersController
    participant TenderService as TendersService
    participant OfferService as SupplierOffersService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Manager->>UI: Ouvre Appels d'offres
    UI->>NeedAPI: GET /api/v1/department-needs?status=SUBMITTED
    NeedAPI->>DB: Read needs and items
    DB-->>UI: Besoins disponibles

    Manager->>UI: Cree un appel d'offres depuis un besoin
    UI->>TenderAPI: POST /api/v1/tenders
    TenderAPI->>TenderService: createTender(dto, currentUser)
    TenderService->>DB: Validate Need and active tender conflict
    TenderService->>DB: Insert Tender DRAFT
    TenderService-->>TenderAPI: TenderDetail
    TenderAPI-->>UI: Tender cree

    Manager->>UI: Publie l'appel d'offres
    UI->>TenderAPI: PATCH /api/v1/tenders/:id/publish
    TenderAPI->>TenderService: publishTender(id)
    TenderService->>DB: Validate DRAFT and future deadline
    TenderService->>DB: Update status PUBLISHED and publishedAt
    TenderAPI-->>UI: Tender publie

    Manager->>UI: Enregistre une offre fournisseur
    UI->>OfferAPI: POST /api/v1/supplier-offers
    OfferAPI->>OfferService: createOffer(dto)
    OfferService->>DB: Validate Tender PUBLISHED and Supplier ACTIVE
    OfferService->>DB: Insert SupplierOffer SUBMITTED
    OfferAPI-->>UI: Offre creee

    Manager->>UI: Selectionne l'offre gagnante
    UI->>OfferAPI: PATCH /api/v1/supplier-offers/:id/select
    OfferAPI->>OfferService: selectOffer(id)
    OfferService->>DB: Transaction set winner SELECTED
    OfferService->>DB: Transaction reject other offers
    OfferService->>DB: Transaction set Tender AWARDED
    OfferAPI-->>UI: Offre gagnante selectionnee
